1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,084
Agent red state mein ho toh paanch common problems check kariye.

2
00:00:04,084 --> 00:00:05,552
Pehla — Tally band hai.

3
00:00:05,552 --> 00:00:07,849
Tally kholiye aur company load karo.

4
00:00:07,849 --> 00:00:09,317
Doosra — network issue.

5
00:00:09,317 --> 00:00:10,721
Internet check kariye.

6
00:00:10,721 --> 00:00:12,380
Teesra — ODBC not enabled.

7
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:15,826
Tally F1 Configure mein ODBC enable karna zaroori hai.

8
00:00:15,826 --> 00:00:17,613
Chautha — password mismatch.

9
00:00:17,613 --> 00:00:21,442
Agar Tally password badla hai, agent mein bhi update kariye.

10
00:00:21,442 --> 00:00:23,676
Paanchwa — company path badal gaya.

11
00:00:23,676 --> 00:00:26,037
Agent settings mein new path daaliye.

12
00:00:26,037 --> 00:00:31,015
In paanch mein se koi ek fix karne se 90 percent problems solve ho jaate hain.

13
00:00:31,015 --> 00:00:36,503
Nahi ho, toh WhatsApp par FLOWRA support ko error screenshot bhejo — team help karegi.
